// Survival: you dig with the best tool you own, whatever is in hand. The kit's Pickaxe (tier 1) takes dirt
// and soft stone; the Drill (tier 2) granite and iron ore; the Bore (tier 3) basalt. Holding the bore's slot
// without owning one digs no harder than the pickaxe. Each tool is picked up off the floor here, as it
// would come from a station or a chest. The basalt sits in basalt, so digging round it can't drop it out.
map
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#............................#
#.....@...d...r...#...a......#
#####################aaa######
#####################aaa######
end
mode survival
tool 1 3
brush 1 0.6
expect 2 tier == 1
mine 3-60 4 0
mine 61-120 8 0
expect 121 is:4,0,Dirt == 0
expect 121 is:8,0,Rock == 0            // soft stone
mine 121-180 12 0
expect 181 is:12,0,Granite == 1        // granite needs the drill
drop 182 Drill 0 -1
expect 190 tier == 2
mine 191-260 12 0
mine 261-330 16 0
expect 331 is:12,0,Granite == 0
expect 331 is:16,0,Basalt == 1         // basalt needs the bore
drop 332 Bore 0 -1
expect 340 tier == 3
mine 341-430 16 0
expect 431 is:16,0,Basalt == 0
